    "text": "By David Kesiena ,\n5 hours ago Purchasing a used vehicle represents one of the largest financial decisions most Americans make after buying a home, yet many buyers approach the process without adequate preparation or knowledge of common dealer tactics. The used car market has become increasingly complex, with online listings, certified pre-owned programs, and varying vehicle histories creating both opportunities and potential pitfalls for uninformed consumers. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
